WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:25.543
In the morning Cinderella listened to the stepsisters.

2
00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:28.687
They were still talking about the prince.

3
00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:32.221
"He's in love with that princess," Trudy said.

4
00:00:32.222 --> 00:00:42.047
"He's going to look for her!" Gert said.

5
00:00:42.048 --> 00:00:45.680
Cinderella brushed away some tears.

6
00:00:45.681 --> 00:00:54.374
"The prince will never find me," she thought.

7
00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:58.457
Later the king's messenger came to town.

8
00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:05.880
He blew his trumpet.

9
00:01:05.881 --> 00:01:09.592
Stepmother and the stepsisters ran outside.

10
00:01:09.593 --> 00:01:14.742
Cinderella followed them.

11
00:01:14.743 --> 00:01:18.046
"Hear this, ladies!" the messenger said.

12
00:01:18.047 --> 00:01:20.527
"The prince found a glass shoe.

13
00:01:20.528 --> 00:01:26.525
Every fine lady must try it on.

14
00:01:26.526 --> 00:01:30.064
The prince will marry whoever it fits."

15
00:01:30.065 --> 00:01:36.327
Gert grinned. "Maybe the shoe will fit me!"

16
00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:39.139
"Or me!" Trudy said.

17
00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.239
Stepmother glared at them.

18
00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:48.284
"It will fit one of you!"

19
00:01:48.285 --> 00:01:57.830
The messenger visited every home in town.

20
00:01:57.831 --> 00:02:10.769
Every lady tried on the glass shoe.

21
00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:15.948
But it didn't fit anyone.

22
00:02:15.949 --> 00:02:22.757
At last the messenger reached Cinderella's house.

23
00:02:22.758 --> 00:02:25.467
Cinderella was sweeping.

24
00:02:25.468 --> 00:02:32.962
First, Gert sat down. "Er . . . grr . . ."

25
00:02:32.963 --> 00:02:35.852
She tried to push her foot into the shoe.

26
00:02:35.853 --> 00:02:38.178
But it didn't fit.

27
00:02:38.179 --> 00:02:41.220
"Get up, Gert," Stepmother said.

28
00:02:41.221 --> 00:02:48.941
"Now it's Trudy's turn."

29
00:02:48.942 --> 00:03:01.823
Trudy tried to push her foot into the shoe.

30
00:03:01.824 --> 00:03:06.270
"It doesn't fit," she said sadly.

31
00:03:06.271 --> 00:03:09.192
Cinderella dropped her broom.

32
00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:11.759
"What about me?" she asked.

33
00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:20.179
"May I try on the shoe?"
